WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.800
The teaching database intentionally contains
imperfect data Customers

00:00:05.826 --> 00:00:11.688
includes formatting differences missing values and
duplicates Products

00:00:11.701 --> 00:00:17.464
includes inconsistent categories and invalid numeric
values Messy

00:00:17.491 --> 00:00:23.595
customers is a staging table designed for the
integrated cleaning project The

00:00:23.622 --> 00:00:28.319
problems are deliberate so that we can practice
detection and resolution instead of working with

00:00:28.345 --> 00:00:29.648
already-perfect data
